    "payload": "<!--gorae-card {\"type\":\"html\",\"artifactType\":\"html\",\"domain\":\"lesson\",\"version\":1,\"id\":\"share-bingo\",\"title\":\"곱셈 빙고\",\"category\":\"subject_activity\",\"subcategory\":\"game\",\"schoolLevel\":\"elementary\",\"grade\":\"3\",\"subject\":\"수학\",\"topic\":\"곱셈구구\",\"estimatedMinutes\":10,\"groupType\":\"individual\",\"audience\":[\"student\"],\"tags\":[\"게임\",\"퀴즈\"],\"description\":\"문제의 답을 빙고판에서 찾아 한 줄을 채우면 빙고!\",\"howToUse\":\"위 곱셈 문제의 답을 빙고판에서 찾아 누르세요.\",\"promptRecipe\":\"곱셈구구 답을 4x4 빙고판에서 찾는 게임을 만들어 줘.\",\"addedAt\":\"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z\",\"author\":\"파란 고래\"} -->\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>곱셈 빙고</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 16px; background: #f5f3fb; color: #1f2328; }\n  #q { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 8px 0; }\n  #b { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; max-width: 360px; }\n  #b button { aspect-ratio: 1; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n  #b button.on { background: #5b4a8a; color: #fff; }\n  #msg { font-weight: 800; min-height: 1.5em; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<h1>🎯 곱셈 빙고</h1>\n<p>문제의 답을 빙고판에서 찾아 눌러요. 한 줄을 먼저 채우면 빙고!</p>\n<div id=\"q\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<div id=\"b\"></div>\n<p id=\"msg\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<script>\n  const rand = (n) => crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0] % n;\n  const nums = new Set(); while (nums.size < 16) nums.add((2 + rand(8)) * (2 + rand(8)));\n  const cells = [...nums];\n  let target = 0;\n  function ask() {\n    const left = cells.filter((_, i) => !board.children[i].classList.contains('on'));\n    target = left[rand(left.length)];\n    const pairs = []; for (let a = 2; a <= 9; a++) if (target % a === 0 && target / a <= 9 && target / a >= 2) pairs.push([a, target / a]);\n    const [a, c] = pairs[rand(pairs.length)];\n    document.getElementById('q').textContent = `${a} × ${c} = ?`;\n  }\n  const board = document.getElementById('b');\n  cells.forEach((v) => {\n    const btn = document.createElement('button'); btn.textContent = v;\n    btn.onclick = () => {\n      if (v !== target) { document.getElementById('msg').textContent = '다시 찾아 봐요'; return; }\n      btn.classList.add('on'); document.getElementById('msg').textContent = '';\n      const on = [...board.children].map((x) => x.classList.contains('on'));\n      const lines = [];\n      for (let r = 0; r < 4; r++) { lines.push([0, 1, 2, 3].map((c) => r * 4 + c)); lines.push([0, 1, 2, 3].map((c) => c * 4 + r)); }\n      lines.push([0, 5, 10, 15], [3, 6, 9, 12]);\n      if (lines.some((l) => l.every((i) => on[i]))) { document.getElementById('msg').textContent = '🎉 빙고!'; document.getElementById('q').textContent = ''; return; }\n      ask();\n    };\n    board.appendChild(btn);\n  });\n  ask();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  },
